  leaving you feeling taller\, lighter\, leaner\, and more elongated. Known
  on TV as Classical Stretch\, this program was created by Miranda Esmonde-
 White\, a former ballerina who\, after experiencing chronic pain\, develop
 ed this method to heal herself. Her approach has since helped thousands of
  others alleviate pain and lead healthier\, more active lives.
